@startuml sequence-diagram-UC-002
title Sequence UC-002 Subir material — FR-004 / BR-004 v0.4.0
actor Professor
participant "MaterialController\n(Adapter, FileInterceptor)" as Ctrl
participant "UploadMaterialUseCase" as UC
participant "Validator\n(Pure Fabrication)" as Val
participant "FileStorage\n(port, Multer detras)" as FS
participant "Material / FileBlob\n(Entities)" as Ent
participant "MaterialRepository\n+ FileBlobRepository" as Repo
database MariaDB as DB

Professor -> Ctrl : POST /material {file + meta} (JWT Professor/Admin)
' GRASP Controller — Mission: single entry point per system operation, UI stays thin
Ctrl -> UC : execute(professorId, file, meta)
' Paso 2: rol verificado con lo que el caller conoce — Information Expert
UC -> UC : checkRole(caller) [403 si Student, FR-003/NFR-006]
' Paso 3: MIME + tamano ANTES de persistir — Pure Fabrication + Information Expert
UC -> Val : validateFile(mime, sizeBytes) [413/415, NFR-005/RST-005]
Val --> UC : ok
UC -> Val : validateMetadata(title/author/ subject/year/edition/tags) [400]
Val --> UC : ok
' Paso 4: cada POST crea Material + FileBlob 1:1 nuevos — Creator
' GRASP Creator — Mission: one stable owner per lifecycle, no scattered new
UC -> FS : store(bytes) -> storageKey [duplicados -> 201, BR-004]
FS --> UC : storageKey
UC -> Ent : FileBlob.create(storageKey, mime, size) + Material.create(meta, ownerId, blobId)
Ent --> UC : material + blob nuevos
' GRASP Indirection — Mission: both sides depend on something stable
UC -> Repo : save(blob) + save(material) [transaccion; E-001 -> rollback + 500]
Repo -> DB : INSERT file_blobs + INSERT materials (RST-004)
DB --> Repo : ok
Repo --> UC : ids
UC --> Ctrl : MaterialDTO (sin bytes)
Ctrl --> Professor : 201 consultable

note over Ctrl, UC : Clean 4: Controller solo delega; sin SQL en controllers (RST-004)
@enduml
